   "text": "The University of Utah - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nThe University of Utah\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nLocated in the bustling urban landscape of Salt Lake City, the University of Utah stands as the state's flagship institution and the region's hub of higher education. Also known as “the U,” we are a Tier 1 research university and a member of the exclusive Association of American Universities. Home to the state's only academic medical center, we offer world-class health care education and patient care. Driven by our goal to become a top 10 public university with unsurpassed societal impact, we're committed to making social, economic and cultural contributions that improve the quality of life throughout the state, the nation and the world.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n13/04/2026 06:50\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n13/04/2026 06:50\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$35,040.00\nMin: US$18,705.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n10%\n3,559 of 36,881 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1850\nCampus(es)\nSalt Lake City, Utah\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n Yes\nContract Start Date\n15/10/2025\nContract End Date\n15/10/2030\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.housing.utah.edu/\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://admissions.utah.edu/financial-aid-scholarships/scholarships/international-scholarships/\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/theuniversityofutah\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\nGraduate application fee is $65 for international applicants.",
